    "summary": "Variable names prefixed with MSG_ cause error with advanced optimizations",
    "description": "Variables named something with MSG_ seem to cause problems with the module system, even if no modules are used in the code.\r\n\r\n$ echo &quot;var MSG_foo='bar'&quot; | closure --compilation_level ADVANCED_OPTIMIZATIONS\r\nstdin:1: ERROR - message not initialized using goog.getMsg\r\nvar MSG_foo='bar'\r\n    ^\r\n\r\nIt works fine with msg_foo, MSG2_foo, etc."
  },
